{
  "competition": "Community Shield",
  "slug": "community-shield",
  "kind": "cup",
  "lineage_note": "FA Charity Shield from 1908, renamed FA Community Shield in 2002. One match, usually league champions v FA Cup winners (early editions had Football League v Southern League champions and Professionals v Amateurs). Season label = the calendar year the match was played (e.g. \"2026\" = August 2026, opening the 2026-27 season; \"1908\" = played April 1908). Not held 1914-1919 and 1939-1947. Drawn matches before 1974 were shared; penalties straight after 90 minutes since 1974 (except the 1908 replay).",
